Z||000022||rockcrawl||03-10-2001||11:14 PM||||Actually it's a FIERO 3800 decal that I got from Gary Gillespie. I wasn't sure if it would look good, but I thought it was neat. I always thought it was strange that the only "fiero" badging on the fastbacks was the nose emblem. It's no wonder so many people don't know what they are when they see one. You can also see the 3800 sticker below the air intake before I added the scoops. <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierographix/fierographix.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierographix/fierographix.html</A> ||||reg||7
